# hair/adult/shag: Shag: layered and choppy to the shoulders, a swept fringe in points, the layers flaring at the jaw; the ears hidden
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
